      "text": [
        " عَلِيُّ بْنُ اَلْحُسَيْنِ سَيِّدُ اَلْعَابِدِينَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"مَنْ تَزَوَّجَ لِلَّهِ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ وَ لِصِلَةِ اَلرَّحِمِ تَوَّجَهُ اَللَّهُ تَعَالَى بِتَاجِ اَلْمُلْكِ وَ اَلْكَرَامَةِ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.4355 - Imam Ali ibn Al-Hussain (as), Sayyid al-'Abideen (as), said:\n\"Whoever marries for the sake of Allah (swt), the Almighty and Glorious, and to maintain family ties, Allah (swt), the Exalted, will crown him with the crown of sovereignty and honor.\"\n[cha[ter=CHAPTER 104 - CHAPTER ON THE BEST OF WOMEN]\nبَابُ أَفْضَلِ النِّسَاءِ"
        ]
      }
